{"id":"conv_05204","context":"An elderly couple reminisces about a recent local event","ambient":"living_room_quiet","cast":["hiroshi_elder","sachiko_grandma"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Last week's summer festival was really fun. We walked around the stalls and enjoyed all kinds of things.","jp":"先週の夏祭り、本当に楽しかったね。屋台をまわって、いろいろ堪能したよ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,4,5,8,19,51,68,262,289,795,1091,2255,3607,3631,3839,4024,4781,6435,7442,8067,8416,11801,16453,16757],"jpTokens":[{"s":"先週","r":"せんしゅう","w":2255},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"夏","r":"なつ","w":795},{"s":"祭り","r":"まつり","w":3607},{"s":"、"},{"s":"本当に","r":"ほんとうに","w":289},{"s":"楽しかっ","r":"たのしかっ","w":1091},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"},{"s":"屋台","r":"やたい","w":8067},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"まわっ","w":11801},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"、"},{"s":"いろいろ","w":262},{"s":"堪能","r":"たんのう","w":6435},{"s":"し","w":19},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"sachiko_grandma","mood":null,"en":"Yes, each class from the local elementary school had a performance, and the children were so earnest.","jp":"ええ、地元の小学校の学級ごとに出し物があってね、子どもたちが一生懸命で。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,4,6,7,22,51,95,486,741,1047,1394,1508,3039,3083,5711,6140,8513,9522],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ええ","w":3039},{"s":"、"},{"s":"地元","r":"じもと","w":1394},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"小学校","r":"しょうがっこう","w":1508},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"学級","r":"がっきゅう","w":6140},{"s":"ごと","w":1047},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"出し物","r":"だしもの"},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"あっ","w":22},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"、"},{"s":"子ども","r":"こども","w":486},{"s":"たち","w":95},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"一生懸命","r":"いっしょうけんめい","w":3083},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"That taiko drum performance was magnificent. A gorgeous stage unfolded in the square — it really felt like summer had arrived.","jp":"あの和太鼓の演奏、見事だったなあ。広場で華やかな舞台が繰り広げられて、夏の到来って感じだった。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,4,6,7,8,21,7